*  065 - capture immediately left of ARBNO: the resume stamp must chase to
*  ARBNO's F exhaust, never clobber G's repurposed body-entry omega.
*  Minimal reproducer of the 2026-07-10 ARBNO-EXHAUST CHASE fix.
        t = 'ab'
        t POS(0) LEN(1) . V ARBNO(LEN(1)) RPOS(0)             :S(YES)F(NO)
YES     OUTPUT = 'capture-then-arbno ok V=' V                 :(END)
NO      OUTPUT = 'fail'
END
